          "finding": "The bundled examination tests collaborative slow tapering of long-standing codeine overuse in established medication-overuse headache, together with preventive therapy. The practice entry tests assessment of necessity for a lumbar biologic procedure and chronicity risk. The treatment pathway, pain syndrome and consequential error differ."
        }
